    {
      "id": "team-news-abstains-without-wiping-verdict",
      "description": "When search establishes nothing, the abstention replaces the team-news sentence only. Replacing the whole answer with it is the exact regression that reduced three of five live match answers to a single boilerplate line. That property is enforced by the required model text above, not by forbidding the abstention wording: the same sentence is correct inside the team-news section and only wrong when it stands as the answer, so a plain substring ban would now fail the target shape.",
      "kind": "runtime-helper",
      "helper": "deliverMatchAnswerOffline",
      "args": [
        "**Verdict**\nI make Arsenal **56.3%**, the draw **23.4%** and Chelsea **20.3%**.\n\n**Goals**\nOver 2.5 lands at **54.0%**, BTTS yes at **52.1%**.\n\n**Team news**\nNo verified team-news update was established.",
        null,
        {
          "queries": [
            "arsenal team news"
          ],
          "results": [],
          "providerCalls": 1
        },
        true
      ],
      "expect": {},
      "expectText": [
        "**Verdict**",
        "56.3%",
        "23.4%",
        "20.3%",
        "**Goals**",
        "54.0%",
        "52.1%",
        "No verified team-news update was established"
